            <td><a href="mailto:info@betteracts.com">info@betteracts.com</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Registered office</td>
            <td>Melbourne VIC 3003, Australia</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>
      We are an incorporated association registered in Victoria. Our registered address is available through the
      Australian Business Register at <a href="https://abr.business.gov.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">abr.business.gov.au</a>
      using ABN 90 406 224 512.
    </p>
  </div>

</LegalPage>
